WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.357 --> 00:00:14.021
Brad: I think they're catching up to us.

2
00:00:14.022 --> 00:00:17.507
Danny: We have to get to the bushes before they do.

3
00:00:17.508 --> 00:00:22.534
Brad: I hope the shrink-gun is still where we hid it.

4
00:00:22.535 --> 00:00:26.050
Chuck: Those two are faster than I thought.

5
00:00:26.051 --> 00:00:30.984
Dave: Look! They're running for the bushes.

6
00:00:30.985 --> 00:00:33.349
Chuck: I think they're trying to hide.

7
00:00:33.350 --> 00:00:43.685
Dave: They can run, but they can't hide from us!

8
00:00:43.686 --> 00:00:46.504
Chuck: Tell your friend that hiding won't help him.

9
00:00:46.505 --> 00:00:49.256
Brad: Oh, he's not scared of you.

10
00:00:49.257 --> 00:00:54.134
Dave: Oh, he will be. He will be!

11
00:00:54.135 --> 00:00:59.631
Danny: I don't think so!

12
00:00:59.632 --> 00:01:01.416
Danny: What's so funny?

13
00:01:01.417 --> 00:01:08.347
Chuck: Ha-ha! You think a toy gun can hurt us?

14
00:01:08.348 --> 00:01:13.581
Dave: Maybe the other one has a toy sword!

15
00:01:13.582 --> 00:01:17.040
Danny: Get up, you cowards!

16
00:01:17.041 --> 00:01:20.690
Chuck: Cowards? Don't call us cowards.

17
00:01:20.691 --> 00:01:24.677
Dave: You're going to wish you never said that!

18
00:01:24.678 --> 00:01:29.536
Danny: Brad, tell them what's going to happen to them!

19
00:01:29.537 --> 00:01:31.937
Brad: Look down at the ground.

20
00:01:31.938 --> 00:01:34.156
Do you see those tiny ants?

21
00:01:34.157 --> 00:01:37.614
Brad: Well, when Danny fires my shrink-gun─

22
00:01:37.615 --> 00:01:41.016
Dave: Why is he talking to us about ants?

23
00:01:41.017 --> 00:01:45.320
Chuck: I think it's time to start beating them up.

24
00:01:45.321 --> 00:01:51.208
Chuck: It's going to be a long painful summer for you boys.

25
00:01:51.209 --> 00:01:54.640
Dave: There's no one to help you now.

26
00:01:54.641 --> 00:02:00.122
Danny: Bye-bye, Chuck! Bye-bye, Dave!

27
00:02:00.123 --> 00:02:03.649
Brad: That wasn't supposed to happen!

28
00:02:03.650 --> 00:02:06.786
Danny: Hey, you have to give that back!

29
00:02:06.787 --> 00:02:09.786
Chuck: What do you think this is supposed to do?

30
00:02:09.787 --> 00:02:11.294
Dave: I don't know.

31
00:02:11.295 --> 00:02:16.671
Maybe you should point it at them and find out!

32
00:02:16.672 --> 00:02:20.939
Brad: My dad's going to be so mad!

33
00:02:20.940 --> 00:02:24.123
Danny: We should have tested the shrink-gun more!

34
00:02:24.124 --> 00:02:28.558
Brad: I know, I know!

35
00:02:28.559 --> 00:02:31.883
Chuck: Bah, this is junk!

36
00:02:31.884 --> 00:02:41.826
Let's pound them.

37
00:02:41.827 --> 00:02:46.573
Danny: This gun works better if you have an imagination!

38
00:02:46.574 --> 00:02:49.308
Brad: Use it, Danny! Use it!

39
00:02:49.309 --> 00:02:51.641
Dave: How did he slip away?

40
00:02:51.642 --> 00:02:53.198
Chuck: I don't know.

41
00:02:53.199 --> 00:02:57.661
Let's get him first.

42
00:02:57.662 --> 00:03:00.168
Chuck: Bye-bye, Danny.

43
00:03:00.169 --> 00:03:06.302
Dave: Yeah. Bye-bye, little boy.
